{
  "schema": "gate_f0_topology_controller_contract_v1",
  "status": "PASS_WITH_HUMAN_FREEZE_ITEMS",
  "research_question": "In a persistent dynamic LISL network with time-varying multi-OD aggregate traffic, finite dynamic LCTs, bilateral terminal occupancy, nonzero stateful reconfiguration time, finite terminal-pair lifetime, persistent queues and shared congestion, choose HOLD or one legal terminal-level reconfiguration at common decision epochs to minimize network-wide unfinished work.",
